.nh
.TH podman-system-connection-remove 1
.SH "نام (NAME)"
podman-system-connection-remove \- Delete named destination

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBpodman system connection remove\fP [\fIoptions\fP] \fIname\fP

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Delete named ssh destination.

.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.SS \fB--all\fP, \fB-a\fP
Remove all connections.

.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
Remove the specified system connection:

.EX
$ podman system connection remove production
.EE

.PP
Remove all system connections:

.EX
$ podman system connection remove --all
.EE

.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBpodman(1)\fP, \fBpodman-system(1)\fP, \fBpodman-system-connection(1)\fP

.SH "تاریخچه (HISTORY)"
